cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wickra-darwin"
abstract: >-
  Evolutionary strategy search built on the Wickra backtest engine: a JSON
  StrategySpec is the genome, mutated and crossed over the whole indicator
  registry and scored by a chosen objective, so a population of candidate
  strategies is evaluated at hundreds of thousands of backtests per second.
  Exposed as a JSON-over-C-ABI data API in ten languages.
type: software
authors:
